<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-6564] Incorrect calculation size and keySize for cluster cache metrics</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6564</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;They are currently not passed by ring and therefore only taken from current node, which returns incorrect (local) value.&lt;/p&gt;

