                            <comment id="16729298" author="a-polyakov" created="Thu, 27 Dec 2018 03:32:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;left three open questions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;are the counters correctly evaluated in CacheMetricsEntitiesCountTest
